msgstr "Project-Id-Version: Nexus source documentation\nLanguage: zh_CN\nMIME-Version: 1.0\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\nX-Nexus-Reviewed: true\nX-Nexus-Source-SHA256: d55fcbfe08e9780dbe2450ae0d2c8ecfcddaa1415dd1caaa32e93a000614ad90\n"

msgid "Bounded UART hardware FIFO bytes"
msgstr "有界的 UART 硬件 FIFO 字节收发"

msgid "Select `irq-fifo-bytes` when an exact H743 or U575 assembly needs hardware FIFO buffering with an explicit bound on each interrupt's byte work. The provider uses the existing public UART face, caller-owned TX requests and a static RX byte ring. It creates no task, worker, allocation or second owner. Threshold batching does not establish physical latency or loss-free throughput."
msgstr "当精确的 H743 或 U575 装配需要硬件 FIFO 缓冲，并要求明确限制每次中断处理的 字节工作量时，可选择 `irq-fifo-bytes`。provider 使用现有公共 UART 接口、调用方 持有的 TX 请求和静态 RX 字节环，不创建任务、worker、动态对象或第二个所有者。 按阈值分批处理不代表已取得物理时延或无丢失吞吐量保证。"

msgid "Select the exact controller and clock"
msgstr "选择精确的控制器与时钟"

msgid "![FIG-16: current static generation, typed lookup and private I/O ownership; FIFO selection retains one UART owner](../assets/diagrams/io-evolution.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-16：当前静态生成、定型查找和私有 I/O 所有权；FIFO 选择仍仅有一个 UART 所有者](../assets/diagrams/io-evolution.svg)"

msgid "FIG-16: current static generation, typed lookup and private I/O ownership; FIFO selection retains one UART owner"
msgstr "FIG-16：当前静态生成、定型查找和私有 I/O 所有权；FIFO 选择仍仅有一个 UART 所有者"

msgid "**FIG-16 shows current construction and runtime ownership, not FIFO timing or silicon qualification.** The factory returns one `nx_uart_port_t`. Its selected readonly table calls a private provider built from one shared compile-time algorithm and exact-family official LL leaves. The arrows retain their generation, lookup and call meanings; no forwarding-only runtime layer is added."
msgstr "**FIG-16 展示当前构造与运行时所有权，不表示 FIFO 时序或硅片资格。** 工厂返回 一个 `nx_uart_port_t`。选中的只读方法表调用私有 provider，后者由一份共享的编译期 算法和精确系列的官方 LL 叶操作组成。箭头仍分别表示生成、查找和调用，不增加 仅作转发的运行时层。"

msgid "Selection"
msgstr "选择"

msgid "H743 reference"
msgstr "H743 参考配置"

msgid "U575 reference"
msgstr "U575 参考配置"

msgid "Exact chip"
msgstr "精确芯片"

msgid "STM32H743ZIT6"
msgstr "STM32H743ZIT6"

msgid "STM32U575ZIT6Q, TZEN0"
msgstr "STM32U575ZIT6Q，TZEN0"

msgid "Controller and route"
msgstr "控制器与路线"

msgid "USART3, PD8/PD9 AF7"
msgstr "USART3，PD8/PD9 AF7"

msgid "USART1, PA9/PA10 AF7"
msgstr "USART1，PA9/PA10 AF7"

msgid "Clock profile"
msgstr "时钟配置"

msgid "`hsi64-fixed-cache-off`, PCLK 64 MHz"
msgstr "`hsi64-fixed-cache-off`，PCLK64MHz"

msgid "`msis4`, PCLK 4 MHz"
msgstr "`msis4`，PCLK4MHz"

msgid "Hardware FIFO depth per direction"
msgstr "每方向硬件 FIFO 深度"

msgid "16 bytes"
msgstr "16字节"

msgid "8 bytes"
msgstr "8字节"

msgid "Maximum RX staging, including RDR"
msgstr "包含 RDR 的最大 RX 暂存量"

msgid "17 bytes"
msgstr "17字节"

msgid "9 bytes"
msgstr "9字节"

msgid "Vector"
msgstr "向量"

msgid "USART3 IRQ39"
msgstr "USART3 IRQ39"

msgid "USART1 IRQ61"
msgstr "USART1 IRQ61"

msgid "Normal fixture"
msgstr "正常夹具"

msgid "Baremetal, priority 5, 115200 baud, 8N1"
msgstr "裸机、优先级5、115200波特、8N1"

msgid "Software RX ring in that fixture"
msgstr "该夹具中的软件 RX 环"

msgid "64 bytes"
msgstr "64字节"

msgid "The extra RDR stage matters: FIFO depth is not the complete RX backlog. The TX shifter is also separate. This selection does not change FIFO-disabled ordinary UART or DMA modes. F407/F470 and other UART IPs do not inherit FIFO support from the public API. H743 high-clock profiles, U575 Secure execution, DMA, block/word RX, non-8N1 frames, flow control and low-power/autonomous operation are outside this selection."
msgstr "额外的 RDR 级很重要：FIFO 深度并非全部 RX 积压容量，TX 移位器也独立存在。 该选择不改变关闭 FIFO 的普通 UART 或 DMA 模式。F407/F470 和其他 UART IP 不会 因使用相同公共 API 而获得 FIFO 支持。本选择不涵盖 H743 高频配置、U575 Secure 执行、DMA、块/字 RX、非8N1帧、流控以及低功耗/自主运行。"

msgid "These full inputs use the existing Board routes. The FIFO subsection belongs to the same authored assembly and typed IR as all other resources."
msgstr "这些完整输入使用现有 Board 路线。FIFO 子节与其他资源来自同一份手写装配配置 和定型 IR。"

msgid "Separate thresholds from IRQ budgets"
msgstr "区分阈值与 IRQ 预算"

msgid "Field"
msgstr "字段"

msgid "Meaning and admitted values"
msgstr "含义与允许值"

msgid "`fifo.rx_threshold`"
msgstr "`fifo.rx_threshold`"

msgid "Hardware receive threshold: `eighth`, `quarter`, `half`, `three-quarters`, `seven-eighths` or `full`."
msgstr "硬件接收阈值：`eighth`、`quarter`、`half`、`three-quarters`、`seven-eighths` 或 `full`。"

msgid "`fifo.tx_threshold`"
msgstr "`fifo.tx_threshold`"

msgid "Hardware free-space threshold: the same fractional names, with `empty` instead of `full`."
msgstr "硬件空闲空间阈值：相同的分数名称，最后一项用 `empty` 代替 `full`。"

msgid "`fifo.rx_budget_bytes`"
msgstr "`fifo.rx_budget_bytes`"

msgid "Maximum RDR reads per handler entry, 1..16 for H743 or 1..8 for U575."
msgstr "每次处理入口的最大 RDR 读取数；H743为1..16，U575为1..8。"

msgid "`fifo.tx_budget_bytes`"
msgstr "`fifo.tx_budget_bytes`"

msgid "Maximum TDR writes per handler entry, with the same per-chip limits."
msgstr "每次处理入口的最大 TDR 写入数，使用相同的逐芯片限制。"

msgid "All four fields are explicit. The normal fixtures use `half` thresholds, RX budget 2 and TX budget 3. A budget is independent of the threshold and may be smaller than the hardware batch. The typed IR maps names to the reviewed raw 0..5 official LL encodings; authored values are not shifted register masks. RX and TX have different final encodings. Exact-family status semantics remain in the hardware leaves rather than a universal FIFO model."
msgstr "四个字段全部显式填写。正常夹具的阈值为 `half`，RX 预算2、TX 预算3。预算独立于 阈值，可以小于硬件批量。定型 IR 将名称映射为已审查的官方 LL 原始0..5编码； 配置值不是已移位的寄存器掩码。RX 与 TX 的最后一个编码含义不同。精确系列的 状态语义保留在硬件叶操作中，不使用一个通用 FIFO 模型代替。"

msgid "Steady RX uses threshold, IDLE and error sources. The handler acknowledges captured IDLE before draining. If its budget ends with data remaining, it enables the level-sensitive RX-not-empty source with readback. Subsequent bounded entries consume the tail without new traffic or a second IDLE. Once empty, the handler withdraws that temporary source with readback. Unchanged masks are not rewritten. A refused required change closes admission and retains recovery responsibility."
msgstr "稳定接收使用阈值、IDLE 和错误来源。处理程序先确认捕获的 IDLE，再排空数据。 若预算用尽后仍有数据，便启用电平敏感的 RX 非空来源并检查读回；后续有界入口 无需新流量或第二次 IDLE 即可读取短尾。空后以读回证明撤销该临时来源，不重写 未改变的掩码。必要变更被拒绝时关闭准入，并保留恢复责任。"

msgid "PE, FE and NE describe the current RDR head. Captured flags are acknowledged before that head is popped; its bad byte is discarded and the next status is read afresh. Overrun and a full software ring record aggregate loss while preserving older queued good bytes. `read_bytes` may return copied bytes with `NX_ERROR_OVERFLOW`; this indication is not an exact missing-character count. An empty read returns `NX_ERROR_EMPTY` when no loss is pending."
msgstr "PE、FE 和 NE 描述当前 RDR 队首。先确认捕获标志，再弹出该队首；丢弃对应坏字节， 随后重新读取下一队首状态。硬件溢出和软件环满记录汇总丢失，同时保留较早的 已排队好字节。`read_bytes` 可在复制字节的同时返回 `NX_ERROR_OVERFLOW`；该指示 不是精确的缺失字符数。没有待报告丢失时，空读取返回 `NX_ERROR_EMPTY`。"

msgid "Keep the task and request contract"
msgstr "保持任务与请求契约"

msgid "![FIG-06: current request borrowing continues through drain and quarantine until final release-publication](../assets/diagrams/request-lifecycle.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-06：当前请求借用跨越排空与隔离，直至最终 release 发布](../assets/diagrams/request-lifecycle.svg)"

msgid "FIG-06: current request borrowing continues through drain and quarantine until final release-publication"
msgstr "FIG-06：当前请求借用跨越排空与隔离，直至最终 release 发布"

msgid "**FIG-06 describes the shared request lifecycle. FIFO space is not a request-completion state.** Its optional QUEUED path belongs to an explicit adapter. Cancellation and deadline expiry retain accepted storage."
msgstr "**FIG-06 描述共享请求生命周期；FIFO 空间不是请求完成状态。** 可选的 QUEUED 路径属于显式适配器。取消与 deadline 到期都保留已接受存储。"

msgid "Start the platform from its privileged, unmasked task owner. Check the primary error, cleanup error and remaining effects. A failed constructor can retain cold leases and requires the same owner to complete stop."
msgstr "从平台的特权且未屏蔽中断的任务所有者启动平台。检查首要错误、清理错误及剩余效果。构造失败可能保留冷租约，必须由同一所有者完成停止。"

msgid "Obtain `nx_factory_uart(NX_UART_ID_CONSOLE)`. Lookup is pure and may precede startup; operations require successful platform startup."
msgstr "获取 `nx_factory_uart(NX_UART_ID_CONSOLE)`。查找是纯操作，可早于启动；设备 操作要求平台已成功启动。"

msgid "Initialize a request once, prepare it with `nx_uart_tx_prepare` and submit through `nx_uart_port_submit`. Use an absolute deadline in the live `nx_time_now_us` domain. Keep the accepted request and immutable payload live until acquire-observed `SETTLED`."
msgstr "请求只初始化一次，经 `nx_uart_tx_prepare` 准备，再通过 `nx_uart_port_submit` 提交。deadline 使用当前有效的 `nx_time_now_us` 域中的绝对时间。已接受请求 与不可变 payload 须保持有效，直到以 acquire 观察到 `SETTLED`。"

msgid "Call `nx_uart_port_service` from the serialized task owner. IRQ dispatch moves bounded bytes and latches facts; it never settles requests. Optional wake hints do not replace the request predicate. A kernel adapter must separately validate its selected IRQ policy."
msgstr "由串行化任务所有者调用 `nx_uart_port_service`。IRQ 派发只搬运有界字节并锁存 事实，不结清请求。可选唤醒提示不能替代请求谓词。内核适配器须另行验证其 选中的 IRQ 策略。"

msgid "Use `nx_uart_port_cancel` to request drain. Continue service and preserve storage while draining or quarantined. Join consumers and observers before platform stop; retain the RX ring, wake target and owner until stop succeeds."
msgstr "使用 `nx_uart_port_cancel` 请求排空。排空或隔离期间继续 service 并保留存储。 平台停止前先汇合消费方和观察者；RX 环、唤醒目标与所有者须保持到停止成功。"

msgid "Every TX load checks the request, byte position, terminal cause and current space. TXFT, TX-not-full and TX FIFO empty do not prove the last stop bit has left the pin. Only fresh USART `TC` after loading proves wire completion; task service must still withdraw TX sources with readback before clearing the active reference and release-publishing `SETTLED`."
msgstr "每次 TX 装载都检查请求、字节位置、终态原因和当前空间。TXFT、TX 非满和 TX FIFO 空都不能证明最后一个停止位已经离开引脚。只有装载后新观察到的 USART `TC` 才能证明线上完成；任务 service 仍须以读回证明 TX 来源撤回，再清除 active 引用 并以 release 发布 `SETTLED`。"

msgid "Cancellation and deadline observation stop further payload loads and preserve the first terminal cause. Already loaded FIFO/shifter bytes remain borrowed. Drain allows up to `(FIFO depth + 1) * 10` serial bits for 8N1, rounded upward in the existing monotonic domain with the reviewed guard. UART and TIM2 use the same admitted clock; no extra clock field is added. Later observations do not refresh an existing drain deadline. Missing withdrawal proof at expiry retains `QUARANTINED` storage rather than fabricating a flush or successful release."
msgstr "取消与 deadline 观察阻止后续 payload 装载，并保留第一个终态原因。已装载的 FIFO/移位器字节仍在借用期内。8N1 排空允许最多 `(FIFO depth + 1) * 10` 个串行位， 在现有单调时间域中向上取整并加上已审查余量。UART 与 TIM2 使用同一获准时钟， 不增加额外时钟字段。后续观察不刷新已有排空 deadline。到期仍缺少撤回证明时， 存储保持 `QUARANTINED`，不会虚构 flush 或成功归还。"

msgid "Prove cold programming and whole stop"
msgstr "证明冷配置与完整停止"

msgid "Before effects, initialization validates state/ring/profile separation, exact controller/vector, live clock/reset access and quiet foreign controls. FIFOEN and both thresholds are programmed only while observed `UE=0`. Final frame, enable, TEACK/REACK and NVIC enable/priority are checked. Ownership is recorded before the first effect. Failed cleanup retains that marker and the generated cold leases, closes admission and requires stop retry; a primary error alone does not establish rollback."
msgstr "产生效果前，初始化验证状态/环/配置分离、精确控制器/向量、有效时钟/复位访问 以及外来控制处于静默。仅在观察到 `UE=0` 时配置 FIFOEN 与两个阈值，并检查最终 帧、使能、TEACK/REACK 和 NVIC 使能/优先级。首个效果之前记录所有权。清理失败 保留该标记和生成的冷租约、关闭准入并要求重试停止；首要错误本身不能证明回滚。"

msgid "Whole stop closes admission and drains accepted TX and wake publishers. It proves source withdrawal, disables and joins the vector including pending and active state, then proves `UE=0` and TEACK/REACK clear. Only then may it clear FIFOEN/threshold fields and discard remaining RX hardware data. Missing proof retains ownership. A successfully stopped predecessor performs no hardware access when stopped again, including after a successor owns the controller."
msgstr "完整停止先关闭准入并排空已接受的 TX 与唤醒发布者。证明来源撤回、禁用并汇合 向量（含 pending 与 active），再证明 `UE=0` 及 TEACK/REACK 清除。此后才可清除 FIFOEN/阈值字段并丢弃剩余 RX 硬件数据。证明缺失则保留所有权。成功停止的前任 再次停止时不访问硬件，即使后来已有新所有者接管控制器。"

msgid "Span checks reject aliases between requests, payloads, RX output/count, the ring, selected owner/profile, active loans and controlled MMIO including the known NVIC/system window. Wrapping spans and invalid output alignment reject before writes. The caller still supplies live, accessible, correctly typed storage and observes its lifetime obligations."
msgstr "跨度检查拒绝请求、payload、RX 输出/count、环、选中所有者/配置、活跃借用与 已控制 MMIO 之间的别名，包括已知 NVIC/系统窗口。环绕跨度与不合法输出对齐 在写入前拒绝。调用方仍须提供有效、可访问、类型正确的存储并遵守生命周期。"

msgid "Assess cost and evidence separately"
msgstr "分别评估成本与证据"

msgid "Only the selected owner adds a const-profile link to the ordinary UART prefix; the profile contains four one-byte encodings/budgets. Ordinary byte state, public operations and ordinary initialization remain unchanged. Exact object alignment, Flash retention and instruction cost come from the selected ARM ELF, not field-size estimates."
msgstr "仅选中所有者在普通 UART 前缀上增加 const 配置链接；配置包含四个单字节编码/ 预算。普通字节状态、公共方法与普通初始化保持不变。对象精确对齐、Flash 保留 与指令成本须来自选中 ARM ELF，不能从字段大小估算。"

msgid "The IRQ bound counts RDR reads and TDR writes independently. Status reads, source changes, barriers and wake delivery also cost CPU time. External models check accesses and prove that a drained threshold batch does not rewrite unchanged masks. Counts are not measured cycles, WCET or guaranteed throughput. A separately admitted cycle probe only observes its declared platform; U575's unreviewed DWT capability remains disabled."
msgstr "IRQ 预算独立统计 RDR 读取与 TDR 写入。状态读取、来源变更、屏障和唤醒派发也 消耗 CPU。外部模型检查这些访问，并证明排空的阈值批次不重写未改变掩码。 计数不是实测周期、WCET 或吞吐量保证。另行获准的周期探针只能观察其声明平台； U575 未经审查的 DWT 能力保持关闭。"

msgid "From the repository root with pinned tools and dependencies prepared:"
msgstr "在已准备锁定工具与依赖的仓库根目录执行："

msgid "Successful normal builds must produce the ELF/BIN/map, linked-resource and provider-retention reports, with one selected face and its actual FIFO table. These commands do not flash hardware or start UART traffic. Product protocol and traffic generation remain external."
msgstr "成功的正常构建须产生 ELF/BIN/map、链接资源和 provider-retention 报告，包含一个 选中接口及其真实 FIFO 表。这些命令不烧录硬件或启动 UART 流量。产品协议与流量 产生仍由外部负责。"

msgid "Current development validation passed 90 real-provider GoogleTest/GoogleMock cases, 45 per family, and 18 normal-TOML/generated-factory cases, 9 per family: 108 cases with no failures or skips. Models use the pinned official LL threshold functions and separate FIFO, RDR and shifter state. Both canonical configurations also passed normal ARM configure/build, resource budgets and retention checks for one face, one operations table and seven method slots per image."
msgstr "当前开发验证通过90项真实 provider GoogleTest/GoogleMock，每系列45项，以及18项正常 TOML/生成工厂用例，每系列9项：共108项，无失败或跳过。模型使用锁定的官方 LL 阈值函数，分别表示 FIFO、RDR 和移位器状态。两个规范配置也均通过正常 ARM 配置/构建、资源预算，以及每镜像一个接口、一张方法表和七个方法槽的保留检查。"

msgid "For these two exact `Os` FIFO fixtures, narrowing only bounded intermediate arithmetic removed the linked software division helpers. H743 BIN/loaded Flash changed from 9216 to 8372 bytes, saving 844 bytes; U575 changed from 8948 to 8016 bytes, saving 932 bytes. Each image's allocated/reserved RAM stayed 2296 bytes, including its 2048-byte main-stack reservation. Absolute deadlines remain 64-bit. These are measured artifact sizes for this selected arithmetic comparison, not a zero-cost FIFO claim, a comparison with ordinary IRQ-byte mode, measured cycles or WCET. They do not establish a clean reproducible software candidate."
msgstr "对于这两个精确的 `Os` FIFO 夹具，仅缩窄有界中间运算就移除了链接的软件除法辅助函数。H743 BIN/载入 Flash 从9216变为8372字节，节省844字节；U575 从8948变为8016字节，节省932字节。每个镜像的已分配/预留 RAM 保持2296字节，包含2048字节主栈预留。绝对 deadline 仍为64位。这些是该选中算术对比的实际制品大小，不表示 FIFO 零成本、与普通 IRQ 字节模式的比较、实测周期或 WCET，也不建立干净且可复现的软件候选。"

msgid "Physical HIL is `not_executed`. Neither model nor link results establish oscillator accuracy, peer compatibility, U575 noise immunity, physical latency or silicon erratum qualification. RM0433 Rev9 section 48.5.4/table 402 and RM0456 Rev7 section 66.5.5/table 674 define the reviewed FIFO shapes; other chips and modes need their own exact review."
msgstr "物理 HIL 为 `not_executed`。模型或链接结果均不证明振荡器精度、对端兼容性、U575 抗噪声、物理时延或硅片勘误资格。RM0433 Rev9 第48.5.4节/表402和 RM0456 Rev7 第66.5.5节/表674定义已审查 FIFO 形态；其他芯片和模式需要分别精确审查。"

msgid "See the [public UART contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/uart.h), [shared private algorithm](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/private/uart_fifo_impl.h), [H743 specialization](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/drivers/uart_fifo.c), [U575 specialization](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32u575/drivers/uart_fifo.c), [finite U575 DMA selection](u575-uart-gpdma.md) and [current qualification boundaries](../delivery/qualification.md)."
msgstr "参见[公共 UART 契约](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/uart.h)、 [共享私有算法](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/private/uart_fifo_impl.h)、 [H743 特化](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/drivers/uart_fifo.c)、 [U575 特化](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32u575/drivers/uart_fifo.c)、 [U575 有限 DMA 选择](u575-uart-gpdma.md)和 [当前资格边界](../delivery/qualification.md)。"
